Mix ingredients except L-sodium lactate and L-cysteine&#183;H<sub>2</sub>O&#183;HCl, adjust pH to 7.5 and autoclave under a N<sub>2</sub> atmosphere.  Separately autoclave L-sodium lactate and L-cysteine&#183;H<sub>2</sub>O&#183;HCl in 10 ml distilled water under a N<sub>2</sub> atmosphere and add to the medium.  Readjust pH to 7.5 with 1 N NaOH (from a sterile stock solution). <br>
For preparation of solid medium, add 15 g/L agar (BD-Difco).  <br>
<I>Vitamin solution:</I> <br>
